        "Treatment decision following PAD evaluation.",
        "Oversampled for open surgical procedures to maximize SSI outcome data.",
        "Medical management (10%): antiplatelet, statin, exercise therapy — no procedure.",
        "Endovascular (10%): balloon angioplasty / stenting — not an open surgery, exits pathway.",
